game (
	name "Carol Reed 16: Quarantine Diary"
	description "Quarantine Diary is the sixteenth first-person point-and-click adventure game in the Carol Reed series. Carol, a British expat and detective in Sweden, must solve a missing person case that is unlike any case she has ever taken on - the entire world is in the midst of the COVID-19 pandemic. A teenager who defies his mother's strict adherence to COVID-19 safety procedures by sneaking out to skateboard has failed to come home, and Carol must find him while dealing with the restrictions herself."
