)

game (
	name "Carol Reed 7: Blue Madonna"
	description "Blue Madonna: A Carol Reed Mystery is the seventh game in the series. It's summer in Sweden, but Carol knows that with the temperatures, the crime rates will rise. She decides not to remove her detective agency ads from the newspaper and soon enough a new potential customer contacts her. Artist Christina Falk thinks she is being followed and she suspects the 'stalker' has also been in her house. She asks Carol to meet her the next morning, but when Carol arrives at the museum they were supposed to meet at, she learns Christina has committed suicide. Carol decides to investigate this; why would someone ask for a meeting with a private detective and then kill herself immediately after?"
	releaseyear "2011"
	releasemonth "1"
	releaseday "3"
