game (
	name "Carol Reed 8: Ambers Blood"
	description "Amber's Blood: A Carol Reed Mystery is the eighth game in the series. On a break between her sleuthing episodes in Sweden, Carol is asked by her friend Stina to look into a problem with her grandfather's obituary. Her investigations end up leading to a much more extensive mystery than planned and Carol is once again involved in a complex case."
