	name "Carol Reed 9: Cold Case Summer"
	description "After receiving an anonymous phone call from a man identifying himself as 'Mister X', Carol Reed is contacted by the local police; the man who phoned her is now dead and she decides to investigate. What she finds will end up getting her involved in the real-life unsolved political murder of a past Swedish Prime Minister."
