game (
	name "Deja Vu: A Nightmare Comes True!!"
	description "Deja Vu: A Nightmare Comes True!! is the first game made by ICOM, known for its adventure games such as Shadowgate and Uninvited. It was released in 1985 for Macintosh as the first in the MacVenture series; it was later ported to several other systems, including the Commodore Amiga. It featured mouse support, a multi-window interface, and bitmapped graphics at a time when text-based interactive fiction was the norm."
