game (
	name "Features of National Fishing"
	description "'Features of National Fishing' is a game based on the Russian STV TV company film of the same name. The heroes of the cult comedy, Kuzmich, Leva, Finn and General, go ice fishing in the upper reaches of the Volga. The fish are biting, the weather is wonderful, the nature is stunning. The vacation, in general, turned out to be literally heavenly, you can't say otherwise. But there is one 'but': our heroes, unfortunately, did not choose the best time of year - spring is in full swing! Which did not fail to have an effect: as a result of natural overheating in the sun, the ice floe with the fishermen breaks away from the shore and begins its journey down the river..."
	releaseyear "2005"
	developer "Lazy Games"
	publisher "1C Company"
	genre "Adventure / Point & Click"
	users "1"
	code "rybalka"
