	description "Another non-adventure game written in Adventure Game Studio, Herby asks you to search the maze for keys and treasure! John 'DRJ' Vanderaart is one of the first published game designers from the Netherlands, best known for 'Eindeloos'. Herby was his first game on the C64, which the main developer of Crystal Shard played as a child; and he decided to update it to more modern systems."
