game (
	name "J.U.L.I.A. Untold"
	description "J.U.L.I.A. Untold is a spin-off games of J.U.L.I.A.. It tells a self-consistent story, unveiling new details about the space mission that led astrobiologist Rachel Manners, J.U.L.I.A., and their vessel to the edge of space. Technically, it is a collection of 50 puzzles. Based on a principle of circuit assembling, the player helps Rachel to reactivate five memory clusters, each consisting of nine regular puzzles and one 'boss puzzle'. There are six unlockable special tiles which become available as the game progresses. The game offers three difficulty levels of the increasing challenging gameplay, and it is suitable for all age groups."
	releaseyear "2012"
	releasemonth "4"
	releaseday "16"
	developer "CBE Software s.r.o."
	publisher "Lace Mamba Global Ltd."
