	description "Set on the plains of long ago, Sleeping Cubis Test of Courage is based on a Native American tale of a young boy and his quest for the vanishing buffalo. To help find the missing buffalo, Sleeping Cub goes in search of the mystical Elk Dogs, and along the way discovers his own courage and bravery."
