game (
	name "Might and Magic: Swords of Xeen"
	description "Swords of Xeen is a bonus game in the 1995 Might and Magic Trilogy compilation (the trilogy refers to Might and Magic III, IV, and V). It was developed by Catware. Subsequently, it was also included in several series anthologies. The game was never published in standalone form."
