	description "It's long been rumoured that Marie-Antoinette, the famous Queen of France, hid all the treasure she had possessed prior to the French Revolution. It is up to the player, directing the famous girl-detective Nancy Drew, to find out where this treasure is. While Nancy is on her ski-vacation near an old castle, she begins to understand that this mission is tough, but not impossible..."
