game (
	name "Peppers Adventures in Time"
	description "Peppers Adventures in Time is an educational game/adventure game released in 1993 by Sierra On-Line. The project was based on a concept by Sierra VP of Development/Creative Director, Bill Davis, who also designed the games main characters. The original plan was for this to be the first in a series of edutainment titles, in which the player, as Pepper, traveled back in time to set right mixed-up situations, surrounding famous individuals in history. The games working title was Twisty History."
