game (
	name "Pilot Brothers 3: Back Side of the Earth"
	description "The game takes place in Berdichev, in the spring of 1958. The brothers read a newspaper and learn from it that the elephant population on the island of Tasmania has begun to decline sharply. They decide to go there by plane to find out who is to blame for this. At the end of the game, it turns out that the elephants were being actively kidnapped by Karbofos."
