	name "Quest for Glory IV: Shadows of Darkness"
	description "Dark magic has drawn you to Mordavia. Undead creatures walk the forest by night; everyone you meet seems strange and uneasy. It's up to you to make friends, influence people, and unravel the mysteries of the Dark One - all before breakfast. Shadows of Darkness cover the land; it's time to be a Hero again!"
