game (
	name "Space Madness"
	description "Space Madness is an comedy adventure game, set in space. Professor Marty is a mad scientist who attempts to clone himself, but every experiment he conducts fails. His latest experiment produces a rectangular yellow mutant named Ed, who Marty sends through his ship's garbage disposal. Ed survives the crash, and finds himself on a desert planet. There, he meets many more mutants and discovers that Professor Marty's experiments are a threat to the entire universe."
