game (
	name "The Key to Time"
	description "Travel the lengths of time and space to recover the only object that can dispel the time storms. Meet old enemies - and make new friends! Vie with android guards and develop your dress sense. Help is available, but only a wally would need it. Last of all, discover the secret clue which will help you solve the mystery of 'Malice in Wonderland' - Lumpsoft's next great adventure!"
