game (
	name "Winnie the Pooh in the Hundred Acre Wood"
	description "Early this morning, a strong wind went through the hundred acre wood and picked up many objects and scattered them about. It is your job to locate all the objects, determine who the proper owners are, and return them. You had better hurry though, before the wind returns again! Along the way youll meet all the familiar Winnie The Pooh characters including Eeyore, Owl, Tigger, and Piglet."
